iki2.0/images/w_585/h_1004/1069/109198/2023/2/28/254967.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_585/h_1004/1069/109198/2023/2/28/254967.png\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; color: rgb(234, 13, 13);\">已经提交过申请，但是没有收到补偿，那么操作方法：（3.13之前没提交过申请的就不用看了）</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">1. 登录https://shiftup.zendesk.com/hc/zh-tw/requests（比如谷歌）</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">2. 全是繁体字，都能看得懂<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1030\" data-height=\"614\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1030/h_614/1069/109198/2023/2/28/742795.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1030/h_614/1069/109198/2023/2/28/742795.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">3. 点击3月7日的那个标题</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"673\" data-height=\"874\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_673/h_874/1069/109198/2023/2/28/774071.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_673/h_874/1069/109198/2023/2/28/774071.png\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">4. 点击“建立后续跟进”，出现下面</div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1015\" data-height=\"543\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1015/h_543/1069/109198/2023/2/28/3038.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1015/h_543/1069/109198/2023/2/28/3038.png\"></div>5. 改写内容部分：</div><div class=\"div-img\">填上 “同意O” 就行了。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">6. 持续关注新的标题状态</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">7. 最后会出现这个（翻译后）：<div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"738\" data-height=\"947\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_738/h_947/1069/109198/2023/2/28/735048.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_738/h_947/1069/109198/2023/2/28/735048.png\"></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></di